<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-31T00:55:30.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:55:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen attacked a Plateau community, killing four civilians and later burned a vigilante office while troops arrested two suspects. In Ekiti, Sowore was assaulted by alleged political thugs and accused police of downplaying the incident, while another report says he was abducted. Nigerian troops killed 48 ISWAP fighters and one soldier in battles in Borno and Yobe. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOQi1qVHBZSnZUdUU5NjJGVkd5RGJIZmlfbjJFQ0dSTE1BYk1SOXo2S2xOZTZyUWRnVWtkNmthZnZiemxHTEM1RGpNZjVkcGE0elhPSDBBcElhR2dubWdtcjhKMVk2ZjJmdXVvS1pwMENPU1B5ZnN3QzB6a2FrOUdOYlJoUFZlc0QwdDJsOW1uNmNGLUQ2R0ZSU0Vyd0d4bHkybmRIck9kZnRmOWRqVTJSbFBLRHd5Ri1fVmFQc2xB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxPZmRPZDZzc3M0RTNvT0M4LU4tRVhWMDA5NXFMajBlSWFiZnBpZkF1UFQtdTFDbkQ1ZmpOaDJaOWRVdElsenlzX1JacjJkTVJpQTJCRlBKQmRLLUVwNnNBWkpBLTZ5eFM2X3pRTHRGNEF3cnUtNUw2dGstM3kxWktfVjlLREM5QTRpTmFqa3h0LU5hbU9TZWZqOUgwbXp4MDU2emc?oc=5&quot;&gt;News On AIR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9PaVpsd0Z1QW5BVXdWVlNKdHpWYlRUdml3YWRwXzhqOWd0Qld6WWRfQnFvY3dfRU1ueTJpWWpNclNGNlVudnFGbS1RTnYzZjJ1S19Lejh0RkpXNFJSRFVGOE1ZUXZ6Tnhzb3Q4bDBRbXpSNndRNzNPSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxQS0Y3TUNnMnp1cndpaFplUEFNVS12NHpLcTZPR3ZFOGdqUEtYQlRqNUhySDUtbFVOSlEtcC1UNm9mLWtrbkhKbVZwQk5oUUVFWXEyeTN3OUZoUjM2SThXc2dUejZjS0xnNFQ1anZsdFl0TmhfYlBjTWxxdi1DeXhzajZuY2VucnVBYlMwY21EU2Z4bFNNNnRVLXNzX1h3N045LTJZTS0wSTRuNlJnQ2VTQVdvTi1CVnNlOTY1SXpMZWNVNWxrdk5hbnVEZjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;ZAgazola&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPNzRBWXZHc